{
  "name": "ListChat",
  "summary": "获取对话列表",
  "tags": "科研助手对话管理",
  "productshort": "eiHealth",
  "region_id": "cn-east-3",
  "paths": {
    "/v1/{project_id}/chats": {
      "get": {
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-interface-name": "IChatController",
        "tags": [
          "科研助手对话管理"
        ],
        "summary": "获取对话列表",
        "description": "获取对话列表。",
        "operationId": "ListChat",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json;charset=utf-8"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n用户Token。\nToken认证就是在调用API的时候将Token加到请求消息头,从而通过身份认证,获得操作API的权限,[获取Token](ai4sservice_03_0011.xml)接口响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值即为Token。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n长度为[1-32768]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 32768
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n项目ID,您可以从[获取项目ID](ai4sservice_03_0033.xml)中获取。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n仅支持字母、数字、中划线和下划线,长度为[1-128]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 128,
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*$",
            "x-pattern-message": "project_id is invalid"
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n限制量,单次查询总量。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n取值范围[1,1000]。\n**默认取值**:\n100",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "default": 100,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n偏移量,查询起始偏移。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n取值范围[0,100000000]。\n**默认取值**:\n0",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "default": 0,
            "maximum": 100000000,
            "minimum": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n排序规则。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n- DESC:降序。\n- ASC:升序。\n**默认取值**:\nDESC",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "DESC",
            "x-enum-type": "SortDir"
          },
          {
            "name": "title",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n对话名称,支持模糊搜索。\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及\n**取值范围**:\n取值范围为[1-500]个字符。\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 500
          }
        ],
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "https://{endpoint}/v1/{project_id}/chats",
        "x-request-examples-description-1": "获取对话列表。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListChatRsp"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "count": 1,
                "chats": [
                  {
                    "id": "56e0f1b0-ac10-46a5-8fa7-b26831d7d488",
                    "title": "demo_title",
                    "alias": "demo_alias",
                    "creator": "test",
                    "create_time": "2021-01-30T02:34:36Z",
                    "update_time": "2021-01-30T02:34:36Z"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "deprecated": false
      }
    }
  },
